{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karina Katana is a classic 2D-style action adventure in a world divided into individual levels with 8 exciting biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/extras/bd08ea9ee09aaecb154320665d2804f3.avif?t=1764709906\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You level up your skills to traverse the different worlds and fight 8 different types of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every opponent has different strengths and weaknesses. You need to recognize these and use them against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/extras/860ebdcd1c99aaf309a8dfa446c67ae3.avif?t=1764709906\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy drops different items when you defeat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your opponents' items and use them to improve your weapons and skills in the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/extras/f14a41b47f21f9175458f21889a63a8a.avif?t=1764709906\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items / Skins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find new items in the newly unlocked biomes and unlock new skins by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/extras/87961ecdde6883de907374a938f88999.avif?t=1764709906\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speedrunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level also has a timer with which you can see your speed so you can be faster next time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also get up to 3 badges for different challenges for each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/extras/3c8753d783545de533d0e6d7cf75c31a.avif?t=1764709906\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fashionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/4589e601ec2d69247ddaf239e84c73e938aafb9a.jpg"},{"name":"Last Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/20ea18af51dad1331bcc709d5d37392fb201db75.jpg"},{"name":"Hardcore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/db0181f10ab88ddf8fc3f629d1033ae1897f84f3.jpg"},{"name":"Bamboozled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/6454c8fb1840196656fe3170e4dfac02302f2715.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/c04df596c6ff8fcbae8aec2490632d435bb7a0b7.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/73e91140c9487aa18edb76aa4d24cc0b782de1b7.jpg"},{"name":" Perfectionist I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/c12adc185cd5eee2bfa0f4afd9bf7f9576463df6.jpg"},{"name":"Touch Grass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/65c2d75079cb01bb0cf64042e29f99b79c095286.jpg"},{"name":"Blacksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/5b74ab17928a4e97d901f26ac4aac56d7eadb92d.jpg"},{"name":"Snowy Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/e96cd58eed28835b96f6124303255792ee8a1e0c.jpg"}],"