 to improve your weapons and skills in the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/extras/f14a41b47f21f9175458f21889a63a8a.avif?t=1764709906\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items / Skins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find new items in the newly unlocked biomes and unlock new skins by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/extras/87961ecdde6883de907374a938f88999.avif?t=1764709906\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speedrunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level also has a timer with which you can see your speed so you can be faster next time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also get up to 3 badges for different challenges for each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/extras/3c8753d783545de533d0e6d7cf75c31a.avif?t=1764709906\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p>","developers":["JOZU GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731530/9421e839f6e19fb25cf904db56d4b8684a5e8740/header.jpg?t=1764709906","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2731530/638616/7daf26f9b1f11f55665501bf3cdd31a970aea23f/1750895124/dash_av1.mpd?t=1702667271","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2731530/638616/7daf26f9b1f11f55665501bf3cdd31a970aea23f/1750895124/dash_h264.mpd?t=1702667271","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/27